\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.16}{\ignorespaces Total energy versus lattice constant for the four monolayer systems: graphene, borophene, \ce {BC3}, and \ce {B4C3}. The lattice constant yielding the lowest total energy is shown by the full circle in each plot.}}{174}{figure.caption.34}%
