\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.3}{\ignorespaces Atomic structures of the hydrogen-functionalized beryllene phases. Left: double-sided hydrogen-terminated $\alpha $-beryllene; Middle: single-sided hydrogen-terminated $\beta $-beryllene; Right: double-sided hydrogen-terminated $\beta $-beryllene. Upper row: top views; Middle and lower rows: side views along the $x$ and $y$ axes, respectively.}}{231}{figure.caption.90}%
